{% comment %}
  Outlight Ads Console — Landing Page
  Assign this template to a page with handle "outlight-ads-console" in Shopify admin.
{% endcomment %}

<div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 md:py-24">
  <h1 class="font-heading text-3xl md:text-4xl font-[300] text-[#131314] mb-10">Outlight Ads Console</h1>

  <div class="landing-body font-body text-sm md:text-base font-[300] text-[#2d3338] leading-relaxed">
    <p class="mb-8">Outlight Ads Console is an internal reporting and campaign management tool used by authorized Outlight employees to manage Outlight's own advertising operations.</p>

    <h2>Purpose</h2>
    <p>The tool is used to review campaign performance, monitor approved assets, and support manual campaign management workflows for Outlight's Pinterest advertiser account.</p>

    <h2>Who can use it</h2>
    <p>This tool is not a public product. Access is restricted to authorized Outlight team members.</p>

    <h2>What it does</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Reviews account and campaign performance</li>
      <li>Surfaces reporting and operational insights</li>
      <li>Supports approved campaign management actions for Outlight's own advertiser account</li>
      <li>Maintains internal approval and audit workflows for operational changes</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>What it does not do</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>It does not scrape Pinterest</li>
      <li>It does not provide competitor benchmarking</li>
      <li>It does not sell or share Pinterest data with third parties</li>
      <li>It does not use Pinterest data to target users outside Pinterest</li>
      <li>It is not a public multi-account advertising platform</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>For questions about this tool, contact <a href="mailto:support@outlight.us">support@outlight.us</a>.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .landing-body h2 {
    font-family: 'Newsreader', serif;
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: #131314;
    margin-top: 2.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
  .landing-body p {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .landing-body ul {
    list-style: disc;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }
  .landing-body li {
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
  }
  .landing-body a {
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 4px;
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }
  .landing-body a:hover {
    color: #131314;
  }
</style>
